{
  "name": "n8n 呼叫 LINE 發送推播訊息範例",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📤 n8n 呼叫 LINE Message 服務（主動推播）\n\n1. **手動觸發 (Manual Trigger)**：手動點擊執行，或更換為 Schedule 定時排程。\n2. **設定推播內容 (Set)**：填入目標 LINE 用戶 ID (`userId`) 與欲發送的訊息文字。\n   ⚠️ **注意**：範本預設的 `targetUserId` 是假資料，請至 LINE Developers > Basic settings 複製您的「Your user ID」替換！\n3. **呼叫 LINE Push API (HTTP Request)**：透過 Header Auth 憑證驗證，向 LINE 發送推播通知。",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 460
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        160
      ],
      "id": "sticky-note-push-message",
      "name": "流程說明"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -160,
        460
      ],
      "id": "manual-trigger-push",
      "name": "手動執行"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "target-user-id",
              "name": "targetUserId",
              "value": "U1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "notification-message",
              "name": "pushMessage",
              "value": "=🔔【系統推播通知】\n您好！這是來自 n8n 自動化工作流程的主動推播訊息。\n目前時間：{{ $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss') }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        80,
        460
      ],
      "id": "set-push-payload",
      "name": "設定推播對象與內容"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.line.me/v2/bot/message/push",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\n  \"to\": $json.targetUserId,\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"text\": $json.pushMessage\n    }\n  ]\n}) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        320,
        460
      ],
      "id": "http-line-push",
      "name": "呼叫 LINE Push API"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "手動執行": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "設定推播對象與內容",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "設定推播對象與內容": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "呼叫 LINE Push API",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
